  "changelog": "Initial release of Mindkeeper, a tool for converting daily memory into actionable owner briefs.\n\n- Reads daily memory from a markdown file and/or messages from a lossless-claw SQLite database.\n- Extracts structured highlights, decisions, open loops, and next-step recommendations.\n- Produces briefs in text or HTML format; supports output file writing.\n- Includes multiple brief modes (hybrid, lossless-only).\n- Supports sending generated briefs via email, including Nexlink integration.\n- Runs locally and provides a validation script for setup verification.",
